{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":491463,"name":"비빔밥 김","username":"bibimbap","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/b/43a26b/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-15T07:00:05.370Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-491463-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-491463-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-491463-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-491463-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot 0.47.0 stable, Windows.\u003cbr\u003e\nAll bots silent (Jarvis, Ethan). “ok” gets no reply.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e2026-09-15 KST: local PC reboot during local capture → Quit/relaunch → Update Agent Computer → Reset Agent Computer → Privacy Mode on.\u003cbr\u003e\nLocal Grok Bot processes are running. Still no replies.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease rebuild my Agent Computer on your side.\u003cbr\u003e\nI will not reset / update / logout / reinstall again.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-491463-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-491463-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Grok Bot\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSend “ok” to any bot\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNo reply\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-491463-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-491463-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBot replies\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-491463-operating-system-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-491463-operating-system-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWindows 10/11\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-491463-version-information-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-491463-version-information-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot 0.47.0 stable\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-491463-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-491463-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes - Cursor is unusable\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-15T07:58:43.946Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":22,"reads":5,"readers_count":4,"score":91.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":171704,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-0-47-0-windows-all-bots-no-reply-after-reset","display_username":"비빔밥 김","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":1}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":137838,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-0-47-0-windows-all-bots-no-reply-after-reset/171704/1","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":1}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":1,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":491508,"name":"Dean Rie","username":"deanrie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-15T07:58:22.325Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey, Agent Computer is fine. Nothing is stuck on our side. Both the Update and Reset you ran completed normally, bots, files, and logins are all intact. Please don’t run Reset, Update, or a reinstall again for this, it won’t change anything.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat actually happened is your account used up its weekly included Grok Bot usage, roughly on Tuesday around 13:30 KST. After that, each message is accepted but rejected before the bot can reply, so you see silence. At that point the app should show a clear “usage limit reached” notification, and right now it doesn’t. This is a known issue we’re tracking, and I’ve passed your report to the team.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYou can see the remaining usage and the exact reset time in the app at Settings \u0026gt; Usage, that’s the most reliable source. For your account, the reset should happen around Monday, September 21, in the first half of the day KST. After it resets, just send your message again and the bots will work.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you don’t want to wait, go to \u003ca href=\"http://cursor.com/dashboard/spending\"\u003ecursor.com/dashboard/spending\u003c/a\u003e using the same Grok account you use for Grok Bot, and enable On-Demand usage with a monthly limit you’re comfortable with. Bots should resume within a couple of minutes. Cursor Pro is a separate product and doesn’t add Grok Bot usage, so you don’t need to buy it for this.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOne more thing, it looks like you have two copies of the app logged in, 0.47.0 and 0.51.0. Keep only the newer one running to avoid confusion.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-15T07:58:22.325Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":6,"readers_count":5,"score":1.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":171704,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-0-47-0-windows-all-bots-no-reply-after-reset","display_username":"Dea